      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "OFF THE CHART (1) was a Free For All winner two back then out of the placings latest at Sandown but moves to Box 1 this time where he has performed well. This looks easier and expected to bounce back. HIGHLY POTENT (2) has a terrific record this trip with three wins and three placings from six starts. In the money last time at Warragul (22.73) in a Grade 5, finishing a nose second. Among the main chances. ELITE INTENTION (7) is having his first start around this circuit. Comes here after a last start 4th and beaten 3.5 lengths (19.82) at Traralgon. Key runner who gets his chance to atone. FLAGMAN FRANKY (8) is new to this course but should be in the mix.",
